    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the moon world Mordain, a suffocating veil of Eternal Darkness emerges. In a cryptic vision, the formidable warrior, Leia Blackthorne, crosses paths with a mysterious being - 'The Watcher' - who impels her towards the town of Grimstead. A foreboding darkness awaits her, veiling untold secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark world of Brides of Bloodbane dripping with atmosphere, discover the unknown, travel between the 'Real World' and the 'Spirit World', search for hidden loot and rewards - vanquish the overwhelming threats that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 5 unique heroes, play alone or with 4 friends. Unlock multiple spells, upgrade your weapons, become the most powerful hero in the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover whispers of Fate and Interwoven Tales in the Shattered Realms of Mordain.</p>",
